### Run DPDPA Compliance Audit Scan

Scanner skips agent/IDE dirs (`.agents`, `.cursor`, `.claude`, …) and `.env*`
files. Run from the plugin scripts path (or Cursor local plugin install):

```bash
python3 <plugin>/scripts/dpdp_scanner.py .
```

Machine-readable JSON:

```bash
python3 <plugin>/scripts/dpdp_scanner.py . --json
```
